 setup tracing   
     
    endpoint   os environ otel exporter otlp endpoint    http   localhost 4317  
    service name   os environ otel service name    fastmcp-diagnostics-client  

    resource   resource create   service name   service name  
    provider   tracerprovider resource resource 
    exporter   otlpspanexporter endpoint endpoint  insecure provider add span processor batchspanprocessor exporter  
    trace set tracer provider provider 

    print f tracing enabled  otlp  endpoint   
    print f service   service name   
    print  view traces  otel-desktop-viewer  http   localhost 8000 \n main   
    setup tracing  
 

    server url   os environ diagnostics server url    http   localhost 8001 sse  
    print f connecting server url \n client server url client 
         
        tools client list tools  
        resources client list resources  
        prompts client list prompts  

        print f found  len tools   tools    t name t tools    
        print f found  len resources   resources    r uri r resources    
        print f found  len prompts   prompts    p name p prompts  \n  

         
        print       60 
        print  successful operations  
        print       60 

         
        print  \n--- local tools ---  
        result client call tool  ping      
        print f ping   result   

        print  \n--- local resources ---  
        result client read resource  diag   status  
        print f diag   status   result   

        result client read resource  diag   echo hello-world  
        print f diag   echo hello-world   result   

        print  \n--- local prompts ---  
        result client prompt  greet     name    diagnostics   
        print 
            f greet   result messages 0  content text result messages result  
         

         
        print  \n--- proxied tools result client call tool 
                 proxied echo tool     text    proxied test  
             
            print f proxied echo tool   result exception e 
            print f proxied echo tool  error -  e   

        print  \n--- proxied resources result client read resource  echo   proxied static  
            print f echo   proxied static   result exception e 
            print f echo   proxied static  error -  e result client read resource  echo   proxied test-message  
            print f echo   proxied test-message   result exception e 
            print f echo   proxied test-message  error -  e   

        print  \n--- proxied prompts result client prompt  proxied echo     text    proxied prompt   
            print 
                f proxied echo   result messages 0  content text result messages result exception e 
            print f proxied echo  error -  e   

         
        print  \n          60 
        print  error operations  expected fail   
        print       60 

        print  \n--- error tools client call tool  fail tool      
            print  fail tool  unexpected success exception e 
            print f fail tool   type e    name    -  e   

        print  \n--- error resources client read resource  diag   error  
            print  diag   error  unexpected success exception e 
            print f diag   error   type e    name    -  e client read resource  diag   error 500  
            print  diag   error 500  unexpected success exception e 
            print f diag   error 500   type e    name    -  e   

        print  \n--- error prompts client prompt  fail      
            print  fail  unexpected success exception e 
            print f fail   type e    name    -  e   

    print  \n          60 
    print  done - check otel-desktop-viewer traces  
    print       60 name         main    
    asyncio run main   
  examples diagnostics client with tracing